# UI registry

One kit, one app shell, many screens. Product copy and transport stay out of
atoms. Paths are relative to the `app/` package root.

## Runtime

| Runtime | App frame | Barrel |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Svelte | `src/App.svelte` | `$ui8kit/ui` → `src/kit/ui/index.svelte.ts` |

Document frame is `index.html`. The client entry is `src/main.ts`.

## Where to look

| Need | Path | Import |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Atoms | `src/kit/ui/<name>` | `$ui8kit/ui` |
| Helpers | `src/kit/utils` | `$ui8kit/utils` (`cn`) |
| Chrome | `src/components/{AppHeader,AppMain}.svelte` | `$components/*` |
| Organisms used twice | `src/components/widgets` | `$components/widgets/*` |
| One screen | `src/views/<Name>View.svelte` | `$views/*` |
| Session / route state | `src/App.svelte` | shell + view only |
| Transport / DTOs | `src/lib` | `$lib/*` |
| Copy | `src/lib/copy.ts` | imported by the app frame only |
| ARIA register | `src/lib/aria.ts` | `@ui8kit/aria` subset |
| Tokens | `src/assets/styles/styles.css` | semantic classes |

## Placement

- New atom → `src/kit/ui`, export from `src/kit/ui/index.svelte.ts`.
- Used by ≥2 screens → `widgets/` (props and callbacks only).
- One route body → `views/<Name>View.svelte`.
- The app frame opens on `Block` (no `tag`), owns session, loading, errors,
  and mutations.
- Chrome is `AppHeader` + `AppMain` as siblings. Do not add a wrapper shell.
- Do not add a second page shell inside a view.
- Widgets and views take copy and callbacks as props. Type-only imports are
  allowed. Do not call transport or invent copy strings there.
- Composition outside the kit uses kit bricks. `*Classes()` stays inside
  generated brick files.
